1
00:00:00,407 --> 00:00:03,437
I don't wanna be a ninja.
I wanna be a cat burglar.

2
00:00:04,278 --> 00:00:08,878
- Fine. I'll be a ninja, you be a cat burglar.
- No, we both have to be the same thing.

3
00:00:12,486 --> 00:00:13,616
(Raj:)Okay, we're ninjas.

4
00:00:14,421 --> 00:00:16,121
(Leonard:)Thank you.

5
00:00:16,623 --> 00:00:19,183
(Raj:)But next time we'll be cat burglars.

6
00:00:24,998 --> 00:00:26,298
- It's locked.
- Are you sure?

7
00:00:27,134 --> 00:00:28,794
(Howard:)Yes, I'm sure.

8
00:00:28,969 --> 00:00:31,459
(Howard:)Now, you stand guard, I'm...

9
00:00:34,808 --> 00:00:36,468
(Howard:)It's locked.

10
00:00:37,644 --> 00:00:41,374
(Howard:)Just keep an eye out.
I'll have this open in a minute.

11
00:00:41,548 --> 00:00:43,308
(Raj:)When did you learn how to pick locks?

12
00:00:43,483 --> 00:00:46,943
(Howard:)When I was starting to do magic
in junior high...

13
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:50,390
(Howard:)...I thought I could be an escape artist
like Harry Houdini.

14
00:00:50,557 --> 00:00:52,317
- How did that work out?
- Pretty good.

15
00:00:52,492 --> 00:00:57,622
(Howard:)I managed to escape friends, popularity,
and every party thrown in a 12-mile radius.

16
00:00:58,632 --> 00:01:00,722
(Howard:)- There. Ready?
- Hold on, hold on.

